OL,3,AMotorcyclist dies after falling into
OL,4,Asea in cliffside beauty spot crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after falling into the
OL,7,Fsea following a crash involving his
OL,8,Fmotorbike, police have said.
OL,10,FOfficers from North Wales Police were
OL,11,Fcalled to reports of a crash involving
OL,12,Fa black motorcycle on Marine Drive on
OL,13,Fthe Great Orme in Llandudno, Conwy
OL,14,Fcounty, at about 22:31 GMT on Thursday.
OL,16,FA multi-agency response including
OL,17,Fpolice, the RNLI and HM Coastguard was
OL,18,Flaunched and the man was recovered from
OL,19,Fthe water and airlifted to Ysbyty
OL,20,FGwynedd in Bangor, where he was
OL,21,Fpronounced dead.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
